        "original_id": "8f69ea50-ba21-55be-afa2-e3a084d1bc50",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Le Rêve de Rico\n- Concepts: Certificate of Primary Education, CPE\n- Places: Mauritius\n- Topics: Secondary school admission\n\nFacts:\n- In Mauritius, the CPE is the exam that gets a student into high school.\n- The Certificate of Primary Education is the qualification students must successfully earn to progress to secondary school study.\n- In Le Rêve de Rico, Rico has to pass the CPE exam.",
